[[Cookbook:Vegetable oil|vegetable oil]]\n*1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Mincing|minced]] [[Cookbook:Garlic|garlic]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Egg|eggs]]\n*2 [[Cookbook:Cup|cups]] cooked [[Cookbook:Rice|rice]], cooled\n*1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Fish Sauce|fish sauce]]\n*1 tablespoon [[Cookbook:Soy Sauce|soy sauce]]\n*1 cup cooked meat (e.g. [[Cookbook:Shrimp|shrimp]], [[Cookbook:Pork|pork]], [[Cookbook:Chicken|chicken]], etc.)\n*2 [[Cookbook:Teaspoon|teaspoons]] sugar\n*½ teaspoon ground [[Cookbook:Pepper|black pepper]]\n*[[Cookbook:Green Onion|Spring onion]] as desired, [[Cookbook:Slicing|sliced]]\n\n== Procedure ==\n# Heat up a [[Cookbook:Frying Pan|frying pan]] or [[Cookbook:Wok|wok]] and add the oil, then the minced garlic. [[Cookbook:Stir-frying|Stir fry]] until fragrant.\n# Add the eggs, and stir fry the eggs until cooked.\n# Add the rice and stir fry.\n# Season with fish sauce, soy sauce, and sugar, then continue frying until the rice is crumbly.\n# Add meat, pepper, and spring onions. Stir again until heated through, then transfer to a serving dish.\n\n[[Category:Main course recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using rice]]\n[[Category:Thai recipes]]\n[[Category:Recipes using egg]]\n[[Category:Recipes using sugar]]\n[[Category:Recipes using fish sauce]]\n[[Category:Recipes using vegetable oil]]","isRecipe":true,"recipe":{"name":"Khao Pad (Thai Fried Rice)","nameAr":null,"servings":null,"servingsSourceText":"","ingredients":[{"id":"source-line-1","name":"1 tablespoon vegetable oil","sourceText":"1 tablespoon vegetable oil","amountText":"1 tablespoon vegetable oil","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-2","name":"1 tablespoon minced garlic","sourceText":"1 tablespoon minced garlic","amountText":"1 tablespoon minced garlic","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-3","name":"2 eggs","sourceText":"2 eggs","amountText":"2 eggs","amount":null,"unit":null,"foodBinding":null},{"id":"source-line-4","name":"2 cups cooked rice, cooled","source